<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1B">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "02">
<configtype typenbr = "2">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1226008" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
PCV Valve Inspection
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A1226007">PCV Valve On-Vehicle Inspection:K14D</intxref>
 first. If check result is not OK, proceed to the following steps.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intake manifold. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426021"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect PCV valve from breather plate.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove PCV hose from PCV valve.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install clean hose to PCV valve (1) and check that there is air flow when blowing air into hose from “a” to “b” and that there is no air flow when blowing air into hose from “b” to “a” as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If faulty condition is found, replace PCV valve.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I7V10A121002.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.591mm" ver = "01" gw = "114" gh = "130"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install PCV valve to breather plate.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install intake manifold. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426021"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
